rooms_desc ({"You are swimming in a big and stinky human-shit. It's surprising, youcan breathe, you feel like a shit-sucker. This shit looks biggerto the north.","You don't see anything, you just feel, you are in a big shit.    There is one obvious exit: south. Evil hourn is here.> Evil huorn casts a death spell at you.Evil huorn did you an INSANE damage.HP:barely alive SP:in full vigour Evil hourn:feeling very wellYou died.Evil huorn killed you.You have a strange feeling.You see your death body from above.Buggerlugs hugs you sadly from afar.Dark Helmet Tomas tells you: Noooooooo !! *hug*You notice Squire Icko smiling happily in the distance.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
